SELECT 'gongkao', '浓度问题', 'kp-xingce-quantity-math-operation-concentration', CAST($${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "浓度问题"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "borderColor": "#f59e0b", "icon": "💡"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "核心心法：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "溶质 = 溶液 × 浓度。抓住“谁没变”列等式，混合必用十字交叉法。"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "一、题型定义与识别"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "题目中出现“盐水”、“糖水”、“酒精”、“蒸发水分”、“加水稀释”、“混合溶液”等字眼。"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "二、核心公式"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "基础定义：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "katexBlock", "attrs": {"content": "浓度 = \\frac{溶质(如纯盐)}{溶液(盐+水)} \\times 100\\%"}}, {"type": "katexBlock", "attrs": {"content": "溶质 = 溶液 \\times 浓度"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "三、标准步骤"}]}, {"type": "text-diagram", "attrs": {"type": "mermaid", "content": "flowchart TD\nA[阅读题目判别场景] --> B{是哪种场景?}\nB -- 蒸发/加水稀释 --> C[核心突破口: 溶质(盐)是不变的!]\nC --> D[列出等式: 蒸发前溶质 = 蒸发后溶质]\nB -- 两种不同浓度混合 --> E[核心突破口: 十字交叉法]\nE --> F[写出浓度A, 浓度B, 混合浓度C]\nF --> G[交叉相减得出质量比例关系]\nD --> H[解出答案]\nG --> H"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "四、例题完整推导"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "【例题】", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 现有浓度为 20% 的盐水 100 克，需要加入多少克纯水，才能将其稀释为浓度 10% 的盐水？选项：A. 50  B. 80  C. 100  D. 120"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "识别：加水稀释问题。核心是“溶质(盐)是不变的”。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "找等量关系：稀释前的盐 = 稀释后的盐。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "算稀释前的盐：100 × 20% = 20 克。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "列方程：设加入纯水 x 克。稀释后的溶液变为 (100 + x)。稀释后的盐 = (100 + x) × 10%。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "求解等式：20 = (100 + x) × 10%。得出 100 + x = 200，x = 100 克。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "锁定答案：选 C。"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "五、易错点纠偏"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "borderColor": "#ef4444", "icon": "⚠️"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "加纯盐与加纯水的浓度定性：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "加纯水时，纯水的浓度是 0%。加纯盐（或纯酒精）时，它的浓度是 100%！在做两杯混合的十字交叉法时，如果不小心把纯水当成了 100%，或者纯盐当成了 0%，会导致满盘皆输。"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "六、刷题建议"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "强化十字交叉法的肌肉记忆：左边写两个部分的浓度，中间写混合后的浓度，交叉相减取绝对值，得出的比例就是这两杯溶液的“质量之比”（即分母之比）。这是解决复杂混合问题的不二法门。"}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '浓度问题的核心考点与实战推导。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "数学运算", "浓度问题"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_xingce_quantity_math_operation_concentration", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
